---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ProvisioningApp from '../components/ProvisioningApp';
---

<Layout 
  title="Password Protect a Folder Online - Free Folder Protection Tool" 
  description="Protect an entire folder and its contents with one password. Processed directly in your browser."
>
  <div class="flex-1 bg-bg-light w-full flex items-center justify-center">
    <ProvisioningApp client:load initialMode="folder" />
  </div>

  <!-- SEO CONTENT -->
  <section class="w-full bg-white py-16 px-6 border-t border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">How to lock a folder</h2>
      <div class="prose prose-blue text-gray-600">
        <p>Locking an entire folder is just as easy as locking a single file. When you select a folder, FileLocker automatically packs all its contents into a single stream before encrypting it.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>No Zipping Required:</strong> You don't need to manually create a ZIP file first. FileLocker handles the packaging automatically.</li>
          <li><strong>Maintains Structure:</strong> When the `.vault` file is unlocked later, the original folder structure and all files are perfectly restored.</li>
          <li><strong>Zero Uploads:</strong> Even if your folder contains gigabytes of videos or documents, everything is processed locally on your machine.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
